{"id":"45d1eaa29871277d","group":"56","path":"56/56-ex-outermost-not-cofinal.md","title":"最外选择可以缺少共尾性","display":"ex-outermost-not-cofinal — 最外选择可以缺少共尾性","type":"example","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","type":"example","label":"56-ex-outermost-not-cofinal","aliases":["56-ex-outermost-not-cofinal"],"display":"ex-outermost-not-cofinal — 最外选择可以缺少共尾性","depends_on":["[[56-df-normal-order]]","[[56-df-outermost-rewrite-relation]]","[[56-df-cofinal-functional-strategy]]","[[56-df-orthogonal]]"],"source_section":"§9.3 Example 9.3.8","source_printed_pages":"509","source_ocr_blocks":[530],"source_verification":"已据本地DjVu提取文本核对对应段落；本节点的独立论证与核验边界见Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"label","html":"56-ex-outermost-not-cofinal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-ex-outermost-not-cofinal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-outermost-not-cofinal — 最外选择可以缺少共尾性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2ebc9e1638fe6861\" href=\"?note=2ebc9e1638fe6861\" title=\"56-df-normal-order\">56-df-normal-order</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e0c0a9b4cfad8f60\" href=\"?note=e0c0a9b4cfad8f60\" title=\"56-df-outermost-rewrite-relation\">56-df-outermost-rewrite-relation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e22d9797b2ac34d5\" href=\"?note=e22d9797b2ac34d5\" title=\"56-df-cofinal-functional-strategy\">56-df-cofinal-functional-strategy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"34fb9d07dfbad48c\" href=\"?note=34fb9d07dfbad48c\" title=\"56-df-orthogonal\">56-df-orthogonal</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§9.3 Example 9.3.8"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"509"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>530</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"已据本地DjVu提取文本核对对应段落；本节点的独立论证与核验边界见Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F=\\{f,a,b\\}\">\\(\\mathcal F=\\{f,a,b\\}\\)</span> 为三个互异函数符号，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}(f)=1\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}(f)=1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}(a)=\\operatorname{ar}(b)=0\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}(a)=\\operatorname{ar}(b)=0\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar})\">\\(\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar})\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span> 为与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\">\\(\\mathcal F\\)</span> 不交的可数无限变量集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(x\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NO}_{\\Sigma,\\mathcal V,R}\">\\(\\mathrm{NO}_{\\Sigma,\\mathcal V,R}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to_R^*\">\\(\\to_R^*\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2ebc9e1638fe6861\" href=\"?note=2ebc9e1638fe6861\" title=\"56-df-normal-order\">56-df-normal-order</a>，最外关系见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e0c0a9b4cfad8f60\" href=\"?note=e0c0a9b4cfad8f60\" title=\"56-df-outermost-rewrite-relation\">56-df-outermost-rewrite-relation</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Orthogonal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Orthogonal}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"34fb9d07dfbad48c\" href=\"?note=34fb9d07dfbad48c\" title=\"56-df-orthogonal\">56-df-orthogonal</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CofinalFunctionalStrategy}\">\\(\\mathrm{CofinalFunctionalStrategy}\\)</span> 与函数迭代见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e22d9797b2ac34d5\" href=\"?note=e22d9797b2ac34d5\" title=\"56-df-cofinal-functional-strategy\">56-df-cofinal-functional-strategy</a>。</li>\n<li>本节中下标中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_1\">\\(R_1\\)</span> 按Assertion给出的规则集取值。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"R_1:=\\{(f(x),f(x)),(a,b)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[R_1:=\\{(f(x),f(x)),(a,b)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Orthogonal}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V,R_1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Orthogonal}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V,R_1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f(a)\\to_{R_1}f(b)\n\\land\\neg\\bigl(f(b)\\to_{R_1}^*f(a)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f(a)\\to_{R_1}f(b)\n\\land\\neg\\bigl(f(b)\\to_{R_1}^*f(a)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\mathrm{NO}_{\\Sigma,\\mathcal V,R_1}^{[n]}(f(a))=f(a).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\mathrm{NO}_{\\Sigma,\\mathcal V,R_1}^{[n]}(f(a))=f(a).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\mathrm{CofinalFunctionalStrategy}\n(T,\\to_{R_1},\\mathrm{NO}_{\\Sigma,\\mathcal V,R_1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\mathrm{CofinalFunctionalStrategy}\n(T,\\to_{R_1},\\mathrm{NO}_{\\Sigma,\\mathcal V,R_1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>根f(x)规则每次被选择，因而NO轨道始终是f(a)。另一条内部步可得到f(b)，从f(b)只有根恒等收缩，无法回到f(a)，这直接否定共尾条件。规则集正交。原书用同一系统说明outermost-fair不保证共尾；本原子只断言已在前两节精确定义的函数轨道反例，不借端点自环猜测有标签公平性。</p>\n<p>来源的OCR页块序号按本地提取文本中的分页符编号，不等同于DjVu物理页码。本轮未作机器证明；计算性未编码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-normal-order","status":"resolved","id":"2ebc9e1638fe6861","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-normal-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-outermost-rewrite-relation","status":"resolved","id":"e0c0a9b4cfad8f60","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-outermost-rewrite-relation]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-cofinal-functional-strategy","status":"resolved","id":"e22d9797b2ac34d5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-cofinal-functional-strategy]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-orthogonal","status":"resolved","id":"34fb9d07dfbad48c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-orthogonal]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-normal-order","status":"resolved","id":"2ebc9e1638fe6861","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{NO}_{\\Sigma,\\mathcal V,R}$ 与 $\\to_R^*$ 见 [[56-df-normal-order]]，最外关系见 [[56-df-outermost-rewrite-relation]]；$\\mathrm{Orthogonal}$ 见 [[56-df-orthogonal]]，$\\mathrm{CofinalFunctionalStrategy}$ 与函数迭代见 [[56-df-cofinal-functional-strategy]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-outermost-rewrite-relation","status":"resolved","id":"e0c0a9b4cfad8f60","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":